   "soundParser": "0x40dad0 (keys sound/sounds, 0x40edf9): S_RegisterSound 0x46a020, appended to the media list at +0x48",
   "playEffectVolumeRadius": "0x407110 stores its volume and radius at template +0x23c and +0x240 (0x407215, 0x407220); the Sound case reads neither",
   "flagWords": "flags 0x40d1a0 and spawn flags 0x40d4e0 read \"%s %s %s %s %s %s %s\" (0x565c00); an unknown word clears the result (0x40d79a, 0x40d4bc) and the loop continues; the key loop ignores the result (0x40edc5); \"lessAttenuation\" is not a string in jamp.exe"
  }
